  "aboutMd": "Marine Drive carries six lanes of traffic every day of the year. For four hours on a Sunday in October it carries runners instead, from Nariman Point to Girgaon Chowpatty and back.\n\nThe first Mumbai edition runs on fully closed roads with the sea on one side the whole way. Flat, fast, and finished before the humidity arrives.",
